      "source": "Create a <a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId</code></a> rendering the offset as UTC offset.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId</code></a> 创建一个 <a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a>，以 UTC 偏移量形式渲染时区。",
