    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a> for the <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> resulting in the Olson Timezone Identifier or UTC\nOffset.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a>，该表达式实现<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>接口，用于返回 Olson 时区标识符或 UTC 偏移量。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a> for the <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Field</code></a> reference holding the Olson Timezone Identifier or UTC Offset.",
      "translation": "为持有 Olson 时区标识符或 UTC 偏移量的<a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Field</code></a>引用创建一个<a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a> for the given value which must be a valid expression that resolves to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>\nrepresenting an Olson Timezone Identifier or UTC Offset.",
      "translation": "为给定值创建一个<a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a>，该值必须是一个有效的表达式，解析后返回一个代表 Olson 时区标识符或 UTC 偏移量的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return an empty <a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个空的<a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 包中的类\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
