      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>value</code> - the plain timezone <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>, a <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Field</code></a> holding the timezone or an\n         <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> resulting in the timezone.",
      "translation": "<code>value</code> - 时区的普通字符串（<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>）、包含时区的 <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Field</code></a>，或结果为时区的 <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>timeZone</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/TimeZone.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>TimeZone</code></a> rendering the offset as UTC offset.",
      "translation": "<code>timeZone</code> - 渲染为 UTC 偏移量的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/TimeZone.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>TimeZone</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>offset</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneOffset.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneOffset</code></a> rendering the offset as UTC offset.",
      "translation": "<code>offset</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneOffset.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneOffset</code></a>，用于以 UTC 偏移量形式渲染该偏移。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>timeZone</code> - <a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a> rendering the offset as zone identifier.",
      "translation": "<code>timeZone</code> - <a href=\"DateOperators.Timezone.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>DateOperators.Timezone</code></a> 将偏移量渲染为时区标识符。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>zoneId</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId</code></a> rendering the offset as zone identifier.",
      "translation": "<code>zoneId</code> - 渲染偏移量作为时区标识符的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>fieldReference</code> - the <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Field</code></a> holding the timezone.",
      "translation": "<code>fieldReference</code> - 包含时区的 <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 中的接口\"><code>Field</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>expression</code> - the <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> resulting in the timezone.",
      "translation": "<code>expression</code> - 由此产生时区的<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Christoph Strobl, Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "克里斯托夫·施特罗布，马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "never null.",
      "translation": "永不为空。",
